{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":32},"timestamp":1792369575,"idle_time_limit":1.5,"command":"bash -c 'printf \"$ scripts/demo_attack2.sh\\n\"; scripts/demo_attack2.sh'","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.008, "o", "$ scripts/demo_attack2.sh\r\n"]
[0.065, "o", "\u001b[1mQuantum-Safe Federated Learning for Smart Agriculture: Attack 2 demo\u001b[0m\r\nA (simulated) quantum attacker tries to log in to the server as farm 0.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33mRun 1: classical Flower (ECDSA P-384 farm login)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.188, "o", "\u001b[2m[1]\u001b[0m Attacker copies farm 0's public login key (sent in every login): \u001b[1mECDSA P-384\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m[2]\u001b[0m Simulated quantum computer runs Shor's algorithm on it ...\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[31mprivate key RECOVERED\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(simulated: Shor breaks elliptic-curve keys)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m[3]\u001b[0m Attacker logs in to the server as farm 0 ...\r\n"]
[0.022, "o", "    \u001b[31m\u001b[1mLOGIN ACCEPTED\u001b[0m: server activated the attacker as farm 0 (node id 285872066706511301)\r\n\u001b[1mResult:\u001b[0m \u001b[31mimpersonation succeeded\u001b[0m; the attacker would now receive farm 0's training\r\n        tasks and the global model, and could submit model updates in farm 0's name\r\n"]
[2.121, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32mRun 2: our version (ML-DSA-65 farm login)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.202, "o", "\u001b[2m[1]\u001b[0m Attacker copies farm 0's public login key (sent in every login): \u001b[1mML-DSA-65\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m[2]\u001b[0m Simulated quantum computer runs Shor's algorithm on it ...\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "    \u001b[32mkey recovery FAILED\u001b[0m: no known quantum algorithm breaks ML-DSA (lattice-based)\r\n    \u001b[2mattacker falls back to signing with a key of its own\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m[3]\u001b[0m Attacker logs in to the server as farm 0 ...\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "    \u001b[32m\u001b[1mLOGIN REJECTED\u001b[0m: UNAUTHENTICATED: Invalid signature\r\n\u001b[1mResult:\u001b[0m \u001b[32mimpersonation blocked\u001b[0m; farm 0's identity is safe\r\n"]
[2.119, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mNote:\u001b[0m the quantum computer is simulated: for ECDSA the oracle returns the real key,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "as Shor's algorithm would; no such attack is known against ML-DSA.\r\n"]
[0.001, "x", "0"]
